{"id": "3841a6bb-d57d-491d-a5ab-c88858c5bd93", "slug": "system-overview", "title": "System Overview", "description": "System Overview Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"System Overview\"\ndescription: \"System Overview Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F76A1C\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#2044F4\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# System Overview\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 4; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, bento, charts, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nSystem Overview Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\n75% CPU Usage 75% CPU Usage SPU 75% Memory Disk 8GB Disk: 500GB free System Overview\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F76A1C, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #2044F4, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>System Overview</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-50 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8 font-sans antialiased text-slate-800 selection:bg-blue-200\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1200px] aspect-[16/10] sm:aspect-[21/10] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2044F4] via-[#A238B5] to-[#F76A1C] rounded-[2rem] sm:rounded-[3rem] shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center isolate\">\n\n        <!-- Background Ambient Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-40 mix-blend-screen pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Connection Lines (SVG) -->\n        <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-60\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <!-- Line to Left Stats -->\n            <path class=\"draw-path\" d=\"M 50% 50% Q 35% 60% 20% 60%\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" style=\"stroke-dasharray: 1000; stroke-dashoffset: 1000; transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.5s ease-out;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"20%\" cy=\"60%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n\n            <!-- Line to Top Left Circle -->\n            <path class=\"draw-path\" d=\"M 50% 50% Q 40% 35% 30% 35%\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" style=\"stroke-dasharray: 1000; stroke-dashoffset: 1000; transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.5s ease-out;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"30%\" cy=\"35%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n\n            <!-- Line to Top Right Card -->\n            <path class=\"draw-path\" d=\"M 50% 50% Q 65% 25% 75% 25%\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" style=\"stroke-dasharray: 1000; stroke-dashoffset: 1000; transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.5s ease-out;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"75%\" cy=\"25%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n\n            <!-- Line to Mid Right Card -->\n            <path class=\"draw-path\" d=\"M 50% 50% Q 65% 38% 80% 38%\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" style=\"stroke-dasharray: 1000; stroke-dashoffset: 1000; transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.5s ease-out;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"80%\" cy=\"38%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n\n            <!-- Line to Bot Right Card -->\n            <path class=\"draw-path\" d=\"M 50% 50% Q 65% 55% 75% 55%\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" style=\"stroke-dasharray: 1000; stroke-dashoffset: 1000; transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.5s ease-out;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"75%\" cy=\"55%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n\n            <!-- Center connection dots on ring -->\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transform: translate(-100px, 15px); transform-origin: 50% 50%; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transform: translate(-95px, -50px); transform-origin: 50% 50%; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transform: translate(90px, -70px); transform-origin: 50% 50%; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transform: translate(100px, -5px); transform-origin: 50% 50%; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n            <circle class=\"fade-in-node opacity-0\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"white\" style=\"transform: translate(95px, 60px); transform-origin: 50% 50%; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out 1s;\"/>\n        </svg>\n\n        <!-- Central Orb Area -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n            <!-- Outer Rotating Ring -->\n            <div class=\"absolute w-[280px] h-[280px] sm:w-[340px] sm:h-[340px] rounded-full border border-white/30 animate-[spin_40s_linear_infinite]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Inner Glowing Orb -->\n            <div class=\"anim-item relative w-[180px] h-[180px] sm:w-[220px] sm:h-[220px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-white/40 via-white/10 to-transparent backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_0_100px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),inset_0_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] border border-white/50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden opacity-0 scale-75\" style=\"transition: all 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">\n\n                <!-- Internal Glare/Sparkles -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] left-[20%] w-16 h-16 bg-white/60 rounded-full blur-2xl\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-[20%] right-[10%] w-20 h-20 bg-blue-300/40 rounded-full blur-2xl\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[60%] left-[10%] w-6 h-6 bg-white rounded-full blur-sm opacity-80 animate-[pulse_2s_ease-in-out_infinite]\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Dynamic Waveform Container -->\n                <div id=\"waveform\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-[3px] h-16 w-32 z-10 mix-blend-overlay\">\n                    <!-- Bars injected via JS -->\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Left Elements -->\n        <!-- Top Left Progress Circle -->\n        <div class=\"anim-item absolute top-[35%] left-[10%] sm:left-[30%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 -translate-x-8\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.2s;\">\n            <div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 sm:w-28 sm:h-28 rounded-full border-[3px] border-white/20 border-dashed animate-[spin_60s_linear_infinite]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg class=\"w-full h-full -rotate-90 transform\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"188\" stroke-dashoffset=\"47\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute text-white font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight\">75%</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Left Stats Card -->\n        <div class=\"anim-item absolute top-[60%] left-[10%] sm:left-[20%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 w-40 sm:w-48 bg-[#F8F9FA]/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-xl border border-white/60 flex items-center justify-between opacity-0 -translate-x-8 hover:scale-105\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.3s, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.3s;\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 sm:gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">CPU Usage</span>\n                <span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight\">75%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-200/50 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Elements (Cards Stack) -->\n        <!-- Top Right Card -->\n        <div class=\"anim-item absolute top-[25%] right-[10%] sm:right-[25%] translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 w-44 sm:w-56 bg-[#F8F9FA]/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-xl border border-white/60 flex items-center justify-between opacity-0 translate-x-8 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.4s, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.4s;\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 sm:gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">CPU Usage</span>\n                <span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight\">SPU 75%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-200/50 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Mid Right Card -->\n        <div class=\"anim-item absolute top-[38%] right-[5%] sm:right-[20%] translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 w-48 sm:w-60 bg-[#F8F9FA]/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-xl border border-white/60 flex items-center justify-between opacity-0 translate-x-8 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.5s, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.5s;\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 sm:gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Memory</span>\n                <span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight\">Disk 8GB</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-200/50 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chip-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bot Right Card -->\n        <div class=\"anim-item absolute top-[55%] right-[10%] sm:right-[25%] translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 w-44 sm:w-56 bg-[#F8F9FA]/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-xl border border-white/60 flex items-center justify-between opacity-0 translate-x-8 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"transition: opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.6s, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.6s;\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 sm:gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Disk:</span>\n                <span class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight\">500GB free</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-200/50 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cloud-storage-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Floating Icons (Glass Bubbles) -->\n        <!-- Heart Pulse -->\n        <div class=\"floating-icon anim-item absolute top-[20%] left-[38%] w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center text-white opacity-0 scale-50 shadow-lg\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.7s;\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:heart-pulse-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Camera/Webcam -->\n        <div class=\"floating-icon anim-item absolute top-[15%] left-[50%] -translate-x-1/2 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center text-white opacity-0 scale-50 shadow-lg\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.8s;\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:webcam-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Settings Cog -->\n        <div class=\"floating-icon anim-item absolute bottom-[30%] left-[35%] w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center text-white opacity-0 scale-50 shadow-lg\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.9s;\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Small square icon -->\n        <div class=\"floating-icon anim-item absolute bottom-[35%] right-[38%] w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center text-white opacity-0 scale-50 shadow-lg\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 1s;\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:gallery-wide-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Planet/Orbit icon -->\n        <div class=\"floating-icon anim-item absolute bottom-[28%] right-[32%] w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 flex items-center justify-center text-white opacity-0 scale-50 shadow-lg\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 1.1s;\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-3-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Footer / Corner Elements -->\n        <!-- Title -->\n        <div class=\"anim-item absolute bottom-8 sm:bottom-12 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-white font-medium text-lg sm:text-xl tracking-tight opacity-0 translate-y-4\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 1.2s;\">\n            System Overview\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Left Icons -->\n        <div class=\"anim-item absolute bottom-8 sm:bottom-12 left-6 sm:left-10 flex flex-col gap-4 text-white opacity-0 -translate-x-4\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 1.3s;\">\n            <button class=\"hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200 focus:outline-none\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200 focus:outline-none\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-3-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Right Icons -->\n        <div class=\"anim-item absolute bottom-8 sm:bottom-12 right-6 sm:right-10 flex gap-4 text-white opacity-0 translate-x-4\" style=\"transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 1.4s;\">\n            <button class=\"hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200 focus:outline-none\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200 focus:outline-none\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200 focus:outline-none\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // Trigger Entry Animations\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                // Animate structural elements\n                document.querySelectorAll('.anim-item').forEach(el => {\n                    el.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'scale-75', 'scale-50', '-translate-x-8', 'translate-x-8', 'translate-y-4', '-translate-x-4', 'translate-x-4');\n                    // Ensure opacity goes to 1, and transforms settle to their base state defined by other classes\n                    el.style.opacity = '1';\n\n                    // Specific fix for transforms based on their initial setup\n                    if (el.classList.contains('-translate-x-1/2')) {\n                        if (el.classList.contains('-translate-y-1/2')) {\n                            el.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1)';\n                        } else {\n                            el.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, 0) scale(1)';\n                        }\n                    } else if (el.classList.contains('translate-x-1/2')) {\n                         el.style.transform = 'translate(50%, -50%) scale(1)';\n                    } else {\n                        el.style.transform = 'translate(0, 0) scale(1)';\n                    }\n                });\n\n                // Draw SVG Lines\n                document.querySelectorAll('.draw-path').forEach(path => {\n                    path.style.strokeDashoffset = '0';\n                });\n\n                // Fade in SVG nodes\n                document.querySelectorAll('.fade-in-node').forEach(node => {\n                    node.style.opacity = '1';\n                });\n            }, 100);\n\n            // Dynamic Waveform Generation & Animation\n            const waveformContainer = document.getElementById('waveform');\n            const numBars = 35;\n            const bars = [];\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < numBars; i++) {\n                const bar = document.createElement('div');\n                bar.className = 'w-[2px] bg-white rounded-full transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out';\n                // Base height mapping to create a generic envelope shape (taller in middle)\n                const envelope = Math.sin((i / (numBars - 1)) * Math.PI);\n                bar.style.height = `${(envelope * 30) + 10}px`; // Min 10px, max ~40px\n                waveformContainer.appendChild(bar);\n                bars.push({ el: bar, baseEnv: envelope });\n            }\n\n            // Animate waveform\n            setInterval(() => {\n                bars.forEach(barObj => {\n                    // Random variance multiplied by the envelope so edges stay small, center varies more\n                    const variance = Math.random() * 20 * barObj.baseEnv;\n                    const newHeight = Math.max(4, (barObj.baseEnv * 30) + variance);\n                    barObj.el.style.height = `${newHeight}px`;\n                    // Add subtle glow variation\n                    barObj.el.style.opacity = 0.6 + (Math.random() * 0.4);\n                });\n            }, 150);\n\n            // Floating Animation for scattered icons\n            const floaters = document.querySelectorAll('.floating-icon');\n            floaters.forEach((el, i) => {\n                let isUp = false;\n                setInterval(() => {\n                    if (isUp) {\n                        el.style.transform = `translateY(0px) scale(1)`;\n                    } else {\n                        el.style.transform = `translateY(-8px) scale(1)`;\n                    }\n                    isUp = !isUp;\n                }, 2000 + (i * 300)); // Stagger float timing\n\n                // Set initial transition for floating after entry animation completes\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    el.style.transition = 'transform 2s ease-in-out';\n                }, 2000);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "system-overview.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/system-overview.jpg", "source_name": "system-overview-DESIGN.md", "views": 125, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T06:36:57.078241+00:00"}